 "summary": "A single Schottky barrier diode in the SOD-123 surface-mount package, blocking 100 V and carrying 150 mA average forward current. Forward drop is at most 250 mV at 0.1 mA and 450 mV at 10 mA, and terminal capacitance is 20 pF typical at zero bias. It is aimed at low-voltage, high-frequency signal circuits.",
